<title>HONG KONG: East Asiatic 1996 net loss HK$27.28 mln.</title>
<headline>East Asiatic 1996 net loss HK$27.28 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.8 loss   vs  2.4 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  51.60 gain vs  0.23 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    27.28 loss vs  9.40 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,161.69   vs  1,746.29</p>
<p>    Company name		 East Asiatic Co (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 19-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE -  East Asiatic is a shipping and wholesale group.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of leasehold properties which is generated from continuing operations.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
